---
import Layout from "../layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Delete your account"
    description="How to delete your LingerCam account and the events and photos in it, from the app or by email."
>
    <div class="prose">
        <h1>Delete your account</h1>
        <p>
            You can delete your LingerCam account at any time. Deleting it removes your account and
            everything in it, and can't be undone.
        </p>

        <h2>In the app</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>
                Open LingerCam and go to <strong>Settings</strong>.
            </li>
            <li>
                Tap <strong>Delete account</strong> and confirm.
            </li>
        </ol>
        <p>Your account is deleted straight away and you're signed out.</p>

        <h2>By email</h2>
        <p>
            If you no longer have the app, email{" "}
            <a href="mailto:support@lingercam.app?subject=Delete%20my%20account">
                support@lingercam.app
            </a>{" "}
            from the email address you sign in with and ask us to delete your account. We'll confirm
            by email once it's done.
        </p>

        <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Your account: your email address, your name and your sign-in sessions.</li>
            <li>
                Every event you created, with its settings and cover photo, and the guests who
                joined it.
            </li>
            <li>
                All photos taken at your events, including their developed versions and thumbnails,
                and their likes and reports.
            </li>
            <li>
                Your purchase records, the push tokens of phones you signed in on, and the push
                token of the phone you delete from.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            Guests lose access to your events' photos when they are deleted, so save any you want to
            keep first. Apple, Google and Stripe keep their own records of past payments under their
            own policies.
        </p>

        <h2>If you joined as a guest</h2>
        <p>
            Guests don't have an account. To remove your photos or your name from an event, ask the
            host to hide them, or email{" "}
            <a href="mailto:support@lingercam.app">support@lingercam.app</a> with the event name and
            the name you joined under, and we'll remove them.
        </p>
    </div>
</Layout>
